"li","Family trading or chemical groups incorporating a new venture separately from the existing firm",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Family trading or chemical groups incorporating a new venture separately from the existing firm"}]]}],["$","li","Pharmaceutical and speciality chemical businesses whose customers or lenders check the MCA record",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Pharmaceutical and speciality chemical businesses whose customers or lenders check the MCA record"}]]}],["$","li","Businesses tendering to large corporate buyers who require a company on the public register",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Businesses tendering to l